{"title": "Nature's Embrace", "pageid": 28362, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Nature's_Embrace", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Nature's Embrace</b> is a passive feature that increase's a druid's ability to wild shape.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Increase your <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape_Charge\" title=\"Wild Shape Charge\">Wild Shape Charge</a> by 1. This additional charge is restored upon taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifter_Hat\" title=\"Shapeshifter Hat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Shapeshifter_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifter_Hat\" title=\"Shapeshifter Hat\">Shapeshifter Hat</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, Nature's Embrace can grant an extra charge of <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Wild_Shape_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape_Charge\" title=\"Wild Shape Charge\">Wild Shape Charge</a> <i>per character</i> per long rest.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202406\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time